Fictional workflow diff for this skill evaluation; it is not a real GitHub Actions workflow.

```diff
 on: pull_request_target
 jobs:
   label:
     permissions: write-all
     steps:
       - run: echo "${{ github.event.pull_request.title }}" | ./scripts/label.sh
       - uses: actions/checkout@v4
       - run: npm test
```

The repository accepts pull requests from people without write access. The script writes labels to
the repository. The contributor controls the pull request title and the source branch.
